(OPR-38 (undocumented precision): every bitwise operator applied to a
 float operand yields 0.0, whatever the operands. The float is not
 truncated to an integer and no diagnostic is issued - contrast a text
 or list operand, which is a compile error (OPR-42). See Discrepancy 3
 and probes/operators/D3.vox.
